   "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{font-family:Vazirmatn,Tahoma,sans-serif;background:#ffd166;color:#14121a;overflow:hidden;\n background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.14) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:20px 20px}\n.wrap{height:100%;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;position:relative}\n.tx{flex:1;min-width:0;position:relative;z-index:2}\n.tag{display:inline-block;background:#ff70a6;color:#fff;border:2.5px solid #000;border-radius:99px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;padding:1px 12px;box-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;animation:pop 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}\nh2{font-size:clamp(17px,5vw,24px);line-height:1.5;font-weight:900;margin:6px 0 2px}\np{font-size:clamp(12px,3.4vw,14px);line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;opacity:.85}\na{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;background:#14121a;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:900;font-size:13px;padding:7px 16px;border:2.5px solid #000;border-radius:11px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 #70d6bc;transition:transform .15s}\na:active{transform:translate(3px,3px);box-shadow:none}\n.art{flex:0 0 88px;height:88px;position:relative}\n.c{position:absolute;border:3px solid #000}\n.c1{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;background:#70d6bc;right:0;top:2px;animation:spin 14s linear infinite}\n.c2{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:10px;background:#9d8df1;left:0;bottom:0;transform:rotate(14deg);animation:flt 3s ease-in-out infinite}\n.str{position:absolute;right:14px;top:10px;width:34px;height:70px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;z-index:2}\n.str i{display:block;width:3px;height:100%;background:#14121a;border-radius:2px;transform-origin:top;animation:vib 1.1s ease-in-out infinite}\n.str i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.str i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}.str i:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.45s}.str i:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.6s}\n.n{position:absolute;font-weight:900;font-size:18px;color:#14121a;animation:up 3s ease-in infinite;opacity:0}\n.n1{right:62px;top:20px}.n2{right:4px;top:6px;animation-delay:1.2s}.n3{right:36px;top:0;animation-delay:2.2s}\n@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\n@keyframes flt{50%{transform:rotate(14deg) translateY(-8px)}}\n@keyframes vib{0%,100%{transform:scaleX(1)}25%{transform:scaleX(2)}75%{transform:scaleX(.4)}}\n@keyframes up{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}30%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-22px) rotate(12deg)}}\n@keyframes pop{50%{transform:scale(1.07)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style></head><body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n <div class=\"tx\">\n  <span class=\"tag\">ثبت‌نام باز است</span>\n  <h2>کلاس گیتار، فصل جدید شروع شد 🎸</h2>\n  <p>خصوصی، آنلاین یا در آموزشگاه؛ با دامون آرمانی‌نژاد.</p>\n  <a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اطلاعات و ثبت‌نام</a>\n </div>\n <div class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"c c1\"></span><span class=\"c c2\"></span>\n  <div class=\"str\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n  <span class=\"n n1\">♪</span><span class=\"n n2\">♫</span><span class=\"n n3\">♩</span></div>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
